{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Wishlist now and stay updated!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Interactive Fiction Detective Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362130/extras/fcb123d27e1e5c67ef94db89259365f0.avif?t=1767682479\" width=800 height=68 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cMaybe something special will happen in my life.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>I used to hope for that.\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hae-eun Shin enters Myungseo High School as a cynical realist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet rumors of strange mysteries start drifting into her ears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roommate who suddenly vanished,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a bear roaming the schoolyard at night,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a mysterious textbook thief,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and graffiti that predicts the future\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hae-eun scoffs; she doesn\u2019t believe in fantasies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But her roommates \u2014 Dahee, Serin, and Minyoung \u2014 can\u2019t hide the spark in their eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cThe world isn\u2019t <i>that</i> interesting!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Hae-eun manage to prove how dull reality truly is?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will she stumble into something unexpectedly fun?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362130/extras/280ffd02547ae0173b35dba8cfa14df9.avif?t=1767682479\" width=800 height=68 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362130/extras/fb06d6cd9527e675fa7814c1a7beb628.poster.avif?t=1767682479\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362130/extras/fb06d6cd9527e675fa7814c1a7beb628.webm?t=1767682479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam through every corner of Myungseo High School and collect clues related to each mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new areas, talk to NPCs, and piece together the information you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362130/extras/33577cb8cae2b9f41787fb66f49ca4ba.avif?t=1767682479\" width=800 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362130/extras/2a6da374bdbdc375e2db0995c5d7a33c.poster.avif?t=1767682479\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362130/extras/2a6da374bdbdc375e2db0995c5d7a33c.webm?t=1767682479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After class, it\u2019s time to gather in Room 502 and put your heads together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect the clues to your hypotheses and build your deductions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you prove your hypothesis, the closer you move toward the center of the deduction board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362130/extras/f6ad01893774bc90a40d40aa5d2352fc.avif?t=1767682479\" width=800 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362130/extras/3f8998eac86bb01653d18b9557a9088c.poster.avif?t=1767682479\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362130/extras/3f8998eac86bb01653d18b9557a9088c.webm?t=1767682479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unrelated fragments and trivial details slowly converge into a single truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the unexpected answers behind each mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362130/extras/9ddae6288437a9977efb6d1653d031ba.avif?t=1767682479\" width=800 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362130/extras/3262da5733b67a120d1bf3a7aa0d8ba5.avif?t=1767682479\" width=324 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shin\u00a0Hae-eun </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top of her class upon admission; excels at logical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Believes life is predictable and romance belongs in books and films.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cThere\u2019s no such thing as something special. This isn\u2019t a movie \u2014 get real.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362130/extras/5567f106ef84708976f0525a23089468.avif?t=1767682479\" width=324 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heo\u00a0Da-hee </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roommate in 502.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright, calm, and surprisingly unconcerned with grades or college admissions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her unexpected questions often open new paths to solving cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362130/extras/1458fba307c18eea4e33c6f43d8c17df.avif?t=1767682479\" width=324 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gu\u00a0Se-rin </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roommate in 502.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easygoing and sociable, well-liked by friends, teachers, and dorm staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knows every rumor and bit of school history, making her invaluable in investigations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggles heavily with entrance exam stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362130/extras/95e4d76d9252d92a70a579faa83dd0d5.avif?t=1767682479\" width=324 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jang\u00a0Min-young </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roommate in 502.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introverted and lacking confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loves books, films, and all things cultural, giving her a wide range of trivia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly observant and quick to notice subtle changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">